I personnaly solved it, on windows 11, by using the local address `127.0.0.1` 

(Angular project)
package.json
```json
{
...
  "scripts": {
    "dev": "ng serve --host=127.0.0.1",
  }
...
}
```

tauri.config.json
```json
{
...
  "build": {
    "devUrl": "http://127.0.0.1:4200",
    "beforeDevCommand": "yarn dev",
  }
...
}
```

`tauri android dev`
